==Description==
The '''Null & Void Event''' was the twenty-fourth event to be added to Tower Defense Simulator. The event began on the 18th of October 2025 with the release of the first night. This event also introduced [[Curses]] in Hard Mode, adding a new risk and reward system.

==Null & Void Battle Pass==
[[File:Null&VoidPass.png|450px|thumb|center]]
'''Null & Void Battle Pass''' used {{GumDrops|Gum Drops}} as its currency, which were collected from enemies. These enemies dropped between one and three currency on death, which were collected by walking near them. These currency drops did not give one {{GumDrops|Gum Drop}} each. The number varied based on the mode played. The rewards could be further boosted by the [[Battlepass Boost]] modifier, which was occasionally enabled by the developers. It would boost the rewards by 50%.

