While the battle pass did have a set amount for [[Hardcore Mode|Hardcore]] mode, that being {{GumDrops|800}} which when divided by total waves would make it give {{GumDrops|16}}, this did not work and [[Hardcore Mode|Hardcore]] mode instead gave nothing.

In total, it took {{GumDrops|21,655}} to complete the battle pass. The battle pass had two tracks, the regular track could be obtained for free and the premium track was purchasable for {{Robux|319}}.

Certain items like [[High Grade Crate]]s were given out multiple times. In total, the '''Null & Void Battle Pass''' gave out {{Coins|4,750}}, {{Exp|2,700}}, {{TimeScaleTicket|8}}, 10 [[Unholy Storm]]s, 6 [[High Grade Crate]]s, 3 [[Premium Crate]]s, 5 [[Nuke]]s, {{SpinTicket|19}}, 15 [[Necromancer's Tome (Consumable)|Necromancer's Tomes]] and 3 [[Molten Monster (Consumable)|Molten Monsters]].

