==Trivia==
*'''Null & Void''' is the first event since the [[Frost Invasion Event]] to use [[Elevators]] for starting matches.
**Despite being true, all [[Elevators]] for this event had been replaced with [[Matchmaking]] in [[v1.78.0]], and for the remainder of the event all nights would only be playable through [[Matchmaking]].
**When [[Elevators]] were first used for [[Outpost 16]], it was likely done to further promote the new [[Elevators|Elevator]] update that was introduced in the [[v1.75.0]] update.
*The Battle Pass for this event is significantly cheaper to complete than all of the previous ones, only costing {{GumDrops|21,655}}, unlike the 27,080 it took for past Battle Passes.

